The '''Log Section''' is a decorative piece of [[furniture]] that can be purchased at the [[Carpenter's Shop]] for {{Price|350}} any day the shop is open, or on [[Winter|Winter 17]] at the [[Night Market#Magic Shop Boat|Magic Shop Boat]] at the [[Night Market]] for {{Price|200}}.  It can be placed anywhere, indoors or out.

==History==
{{History|1.3.27|Introduced.}}
{{History|1.4|Can now be stacked in a player's [[inventory]] and in [[Chest|chests]].}}
